Significance: minor
Type: add

Add the experimental ability extensions feature. With it on, extensions register resources with AbilityExtensions::register_resource() inside the woocommerce_ability_resources_init action, and fields with AbilityExtensions::register_field() inside the woocommerce_ability_extensions_init action, and the product and order abilities return their values under extensions.<namespace>.<field>. A field can set a prime_callback that the list abilities call one time with every object of the page.
